    "detailed_description": "Take a mind-bending trip through a mysterious, haunting alternate reality. Use your newly discovered magic, wits, and curiosity to cleanse the world of glum and find a way back to your family. Experience the wonder of this 2009 AIGF Showcase winner and indie cult classic.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hauntingly beautiful pixel art graphics.<br></li><li>Gorgeous, immersive music and SFX.<br></li><li>5 huge areas to explore, packed with mind-bending action/platforming puzzles.<br></li><li>Loads of secrets to discover.<br></li><li>Unique play mechanisms to learn and master.<br></li><li>An unforgettable experience that sticks with you long after you play.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Take a mind-bending trip through a mysterious, haunting alternate reality. Use your newly discovered magic, wits, and curiosity to cleanse the world of glum and find a way back to your family. Experience the wonder of this 2009 AIGF Showcase winner and indie cult classic.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hauntingly beautiful pixel art graphics.<br></li><li>Gorgeous, immersive music and SFX.<br></li><li>5 huge areas to explore, packed with mind-bending action/platforming puzzles.<br></li><li>Loads of secrets to discover.<br></li><li>Unique play mechanisms to learn and master.<br></li><li>An unforgettable experience that sticks with you long after you play.</li></ul>",
